{"title":"일코하는 황녀님 [19세 완전판] ","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=k3xqR/dJMcaa7zZlC/KEv8GaoiUy3rvi30LOVk80&filename=th3","synopsis":"최애가 살아 숨 쉬는 소설로 환생했다.각종 수식어로 불리는 제국의 황녀, 아그네스 세인트로!일단 돈 많은 황족인 건 좋은데...최애의 인격을 모독하던 혐성 쓰레기가 바로 '나'라는 게 문제였다.그래도 이왕 이렇게 된 이상...기필코, 반드시, 어떻게 해서든 최애의 죽음을 막고 그 앞에 꽃길을 깔아주겠다!나만의 아기 고양이, 카일로가 놀라는 건 결코 원하지 않았다.그러려면 이 애끓는 마음을 당분간은 숨겨야만 한다.게다가 원래 덕질을 밝혀서 좋은 건 없다. 그러니 당분간은 완벽하게...'일코'한다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":38,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":1,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":3,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":7,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":7,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":9,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":17,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":18,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":16,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":28,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":33,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":40,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":56,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":50,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":39,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":22,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":37,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":56,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":68,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":91,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":111,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":66,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}}